guide forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-felsteed
title Warlock Felsteed
category Class
folder Warlock
keywords Summon Felsteed, Strahad Farsan, Ratchet, Zevrost, Kaal Soulreaper, Demisette Cloyce, Briarthorn, Warlock, class mount
reward spell 5784 "Summon Felsteed"
why Your own mount at 40, summoned anywhere: no 100g riding training needed.
class Warlock
levels 40-60
zone The Barrens

# Summon Felsteed: your trainer's hand-off to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet, then
# Strahad's own Summon Felsteed (4490), accepted and handed in on the spot:
# the hand-in teaches the spell. Four hand-offs that exclude each other
# (quests.json `excl`): Demisette Cloyce in Stormwind (4488) for Humans,
# Briarthorn in Ironforge (4487) for Gnomes, Zevrost in Orgrimmar (3631) for
# Orcs and Trolls, Kaal Soulreaper in the Undercity (4489) for the Undead.
# An Undead warlock in Orgrimmar may take Zevrost's instead; the steps here
# follow each race's home city.
# The spell is still a Forever mount (Forever's client tables) and the codex's
# spell data names it a Warlock mount, the `reward` line. The hand-in teaches
# it, so the guide has no separate `learn` goal (lint has no spell data for
# 5784).
# One player note says Zevrost offered the hand-off only after the felhunter
# chain (30) was done; the data lists no prerequisite.
# Riding: Summon Felsteed needs no riding training. Forever client 1.60.1.70532
# (wago.tools): its mount type's MountCapability asks for Riding 0 and gives 60%
# speed; the mount's PlayerCondition 151684 asks only for the Warlock quest
# "Summon Felsteed" (4490). The teaching spell not teaching Apprentice Riding
# does not matter then.
# Sources: Forever's quest data (quests.json, npcs.json); the quest notes
# (data/local/mechanics) for Strahad's place; the reference class guides for
# the order (one of them carries Felsteed; the other has no 40s guide).

step Summon Felsteed (Stormwind)
  only Human
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 40 Demisette Cloyce, in the cellar of the Slaughtered Lamb in the Mage Quarter, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. No quest offered? Finish the felhunter chain first: players report the mount comes after it.
  level 40
  accept 4488                         -- Demisette Cloyce

step Summon Felsteed (Ironforge)
  only Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 40 Briarthorn, by the warlock trainers in Ironforge, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. No quest offered? Finish the felhunter chain first: players report the mount comes after it.
  level 40
  accept 4487                         -- Briarthorn

step Summon Felsteed (Orgrimmar)
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 40 Zevrost, in the Cleft of Shadow, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. No quest offered? Finish the felhunter chain first: players report the mount comes after it.
  level 40
  accept 3631                         -- Zevrost

step Summon Felsteed (Undercity)
  only Undead
  zone Undercity
  tip At 40 Kaal Soulreaper, in the Magic Quarter, sends you to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. The zeppelin from Tirisfal Glades flies to Durotar; Ratchet is a short flight from Orgrimmar. No quest offered? Finish the felhunter chain first: players report the mount comes after it.
  level 40
  accept 4489                         -- Kaal Soulreaper

step Strahad Farsan in Ratchet
  zone The Barrens
  tip Ratchet is the goblin port on the Barrens coast, east of the Crossroads; from the Alliance side take the boat from Booty Bay. Strahad Farsan stands by his small tower on the hill above the town, not down at the docks. Hand in, then take his own Summon Felsteed and hand it straight back: that teaches you the mount. No fight, and the quests ask for nothing.
  turnin 4488 only Human              -- Strahad Farsan
  turnin 4487 only Gnome              -- Strahad Farsan
  turnin 3631 only Orc,Troll          -- Strahad Farsan
  turnin 4489 only Undead             -- Strahad Farsan
  accept 4490
  turnin 4490                         -- Strahad Farsan: Summon Felsteed
